## 6️⃣ TL;DR – What You Need to Wire Up

| Layer | File / Class | What to Export |
|-------|--------------|----------------|
| **Domain** | `src/domain/entities/User.ts` | `User`, `InvalidUserDataError`, `UserRole` |
| **Port** | `src/domain/repositories/IUserRepository.ts` | `IUserRepository` |
