| **Infrastructure** | `src/infrastructure/prisma/PrismaUserRepository.ts` | `PrismaUserRepository` (implements `IUserRepository`) |
| **Presentation** | `src/interfaces/http/express.ts` (or Nest controller) | HTTP route that calls `CreateUserUseCase` |

