## 6️⃣  How the pieces **fit together** – Integration Summary  

| Component | API(s) | Where it lives | Data stored where |
|----------|--------|----------------|-------------------|
| **Assistant / Itinerary** | OpenAI Assistants + Chat Completion | Backend (orchestration) | `trips.itinerary_json` (JSONB) |
| **Weather & AQI** | OpenWeatherMap One‑Call & Air‑Pollution | Backend (weather service) | `trips.days.weather` (JSONB) |
| **Currency** | CurrencyLayer Live/Historical | Backend (expense service) | `expenses.converted_amount`, `expenses.conversion_rate` |
| **Expense notes** | Whisper (voice → text) | Backend (after S3 upload) | `expenses.transcript` |
| **Images** | DALL·E (optional) | Backend (image service) | `expenses.receipt_url` or `trips.day_image_url` (S3) |
| **Real‑time** | Pusher Channels | Backend publishes; Frontend subscribes | No DB column – just push payloads |
| **Search** | OpenAI Embeddings → Pinecone | Backend (on‑write) | Vector index (embedding → expense/notes ID) |
| **Collaboration** | Trello / Notion (optional) | Backend creates cards/blocks | Card IDs stored in `trips.trello_board_id` |
| **Safety** | OpenAI Moderation | Backend (pre‑store) | Reject/flag content before DB insert |

All calls are **wrapped in a retry / back‑off layer** (axios‑retry or custom) and **cached** where possible (Redis / in‑memory) to stay well under each provider’s rate limits.

