## 8️⃣  Cost & Rate‑Limit Quick Reference  

| API | Free tier / limits | Approx. monthly cost for a **MVP (≈ 5 k trips / 20 k expenses)** |
|-----|-------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------|
| OpenAI Assistants / Chat (GPT‑4o) | $0.003 / 1 k tokens (no free tier) | 5 k trips × ~2 k tokens ≈ **$30** |
| OpenAI Whisper | $0.006 / min audio | 20 h voice notes ≈ **$0.12** |
| OpenAI Moderation | $0.0005 / 1 k tokens | Negligible |
| OpenWeatherMap One Call | 60 req/min free | 5 k trips × 2 destinations ≈ 10 k calls → well under limit |
| OpenWeatherMap Air Pollution | Same limit | Same as above |
| CurrencyLayer Live | 1 k calls/day free | 5 k expenses → < 1 k calls → free |
| CurrencyLayer Historical | 1 k calls/day free | Same |
| Pusher Channels | 200 concurrent connections free | MVP fits |
| Trello API | Free (rate‑limited but generous) | Used only for board creation |
| PostgreSQL (Supabase) | Free tier 500 MB | Sufficient for MVP |
| S3 (or equivalent) | 5 GB free | Store receipts & images |

> **Bottom line:** With the free tiers you can launch a fully functional MVP. The only paid line item will be the OpenAI usage (≈ $30‑$50 / month for a modest launch).

